    "detailed_description": "In this match 3 game, a new exciting adventure in ancient Egypt awaits you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA sinister curse has been placed on an oasis. Explore the mystery of the sacred crocodile and help it lift the curse and turn the oasis back into a thriving paradise.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy challenging levels as well as puzzle and bonus games, upgrades, extras, trophies and a gripping storyline!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n- Challenging Match 3 game with lots of extras<br />\r\n- Play through many levels and extra levels<br />\r\n- Create a thriving paradise                                                   <br />\r\n- Win various bonuses, upgrades, trophies and extras<br />\r\n- Solve exciting puzzles and bonus games",
